      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement:\n1. Multiple user can add items concurrently\n2. No request should be ignored.\n3. one user update item, all remaining users notified,\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
